WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:11.698
Miss Gray: We're going on a science walk today.

2
00:00:11.699 --> 00:00:13.482
Greg: What's that?

3
00:00:13.483 --> 00:00:16.476
Mark: We go outside and look for things from science.

4
00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:21.585
Mark: Like animals and plants and weather . . .

5
00:00:21.586 --> 00:00:26.829
Daisy: Psst, Jenna! Five more days until my dance show!

6
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.060
Jenna: Daisy, shh. We'll get in trouble.

7
00:00:31.061 --> 00:00:35.373
Daisy: My dance dress has red sparkles and—

8
00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:37.535
Miss Gray: Girls, please listen.

9
00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:40.700
Daisy and Jenna: Sorry, Miss Gray.

10
00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:45.134
Miss Gray: On today's walk please look for signs of winter.

11
00:00:45.135 --> 00:00:47.681
Greg: You mean like snow?

12
00:00:47.682 --> 00:00:50.882
Miss Gray: Yes, but there's no snow on the ground yet.

13
00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.549
Miss Gray: So what else can we look for?

14
00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.418
Coby: Trees with no leaves?

15
00:00:56.419 --> 00:00:59.272
Maya: Gardens with no flowers?

16
00:00:59.273 --> 00:01:03.670
Miss Gray: Yes. Good. I'm sure we'll see many other things too.

17
00:01:03.671 --> 00:01:06.036
Miss Gray: Please get your coats and journals.

18
00:01:06.037 --> 00:01:15.052
Then line up at the door.

19
00:01:15.053 --> 00:01:19.989
Greg: There's a sign of winter—a hungry squirrel!

20
00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:26.691
Mark: Look! I can see my breath in the cold air.

21
00:01:26.692 --> 00:01:34.516
Maya: That dog has on his winter coat!

22
00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:37.717
Daisy: In the show I dance hip-hop.

23
00:01:37.718 --> 00:01:41.074
It's really fun.

24
00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:44.383
Kara: You two better start looking around.

25
00:01:44.384 --> 00:01:48.111
Kara: Or you're going to be in trouble.

26
00:01:48.112 --> 00:01:50.639
Jenna: Kara's right, Daisy.

27
00:01:50.639 --> 00:01:56.236
We'd better start working.

28
00:01:56.237 --> 00:01:58.895
Miss Gray: It's time to go back to school.

29
00:01:58.896 --> 00:02:05.323
Miss Gray: As we walk, please keep looking for things.

30
00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:13.281
Daisy: Jenna! Watch this!

31
00:02:13.282 --> 00:02:22.950
Miss Gray: Daisy! We're on a science walk, not a dance stage!
